According to `GENERAL_AI_TRAINING_KNOWLEDGE.md` (General AI Training Knowledge & Systems Engineering Reference > 6. Deep Learning Architecture Knowledge > 6.7 Swin Transformer):

Swin uses windowed self-attention and shifted windows.

This reduces the cost of full global attention while maintaining
hierarchical spatial representations.

Useful for:

- detection;
- segmentation;
- dense vision tasks;
